<title>USA: Chase Manhattan Corp sells $300 mln in debt.</title>
<headline>Chase Manhattan Corp sells $300 mln in debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Chase Manhattan Corp was priced Friday, according to lead manager Chase Securities Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER CHASE MANHATTAN CORP</p>
<p>AMT $300 MLN	 COUPON 7.25 PCT   MATURITY 6/01/2007</p>
<p>TYPE SUB NOTES     ISS PRICE 99.625  FIRST PAY DATE 12/01/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A1    YIELD 7.302 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P A-MINUS   SPREAD 62 BP	CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>((--U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212 859-1672))</p>
